s/924708662", "html_url": "https://github.com/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/1561#issuecomment-924708662", "issue_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/1561", "id": 924708662, "node_id": "IC_kwDOBabE0s43He82", "user": {"login": "julianoes", "id": 1419688, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjE0MTk2ODg=", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1419688?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes", "html_url": "https://github.com/julianoes", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "created_at": "2021-09-22T08:35:31Z", "updated_at": "2021-09-22T08:35:31Z", "body": "It makes sense that the MavlinkPassthrough plugin includes mavlink because it also exports all the mavlink headers as it basically allows to send any mavlink message.\r\n\r\nFor the Ftp plugin, the public header does not include the mavlink headers from what I can see:\r\nhttps://github.com/mavlink/MAVSDK/blob/main/src/plugins/ftp/include/plugins/ftp/ftp.h\r\nI only see it included in the implementation: https://github.com/mavlink/MAVSDK/blob/14d1878024cf7531022cdc9622039988f86bfbfe/src/plugins/ftp/ftp_impl.h#L7 which I think is fine and expected as most plugins do require mavlink in the implementation.\r\n\r\nDoes that make sense? Do you see an issue with this?", "author_association": "COLLABORATOR", "pin": null, "reactions": {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/comments/924708662/reactions", "total_count": 0, "+1": 0, "-1": 0, "laugh": 0, "hooray": 0, "confused": 0, "heart": 0, "rocket": 0, "eyes": 0}, "performed_via_github_app": null, "minimized": null}, {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/comments/925957809", "html_url": "https://github.com/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/1561#issuecomment-925957809", "issue_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/1561", "id": 925957809, "node_id": "IC_kwDOBabE0s43MP6x", "user": {"login": "dzywater", "id": 22073470, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjIyMDczNDcw", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22073470?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/dzywater", "html_url": "https://github.com/dzywater", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/dzywater/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/dzywater/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/dzywater/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/dzywater/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/dzywater/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/dzywater/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/dzywater/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/dzywater/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/dzywater/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "created_at": "2021-09-23T16:12:25Z", "updated_at": "2021-09-23T16:12:25Z", "body": "> It makes sense that the MavlinkPassthrough plugin includes mavlink because it also exports all the mavlink headers as it basically allows to send any mavlink message.\r\n> \r\n> For the Ftp plugin, the public header does not include the mavlink headers from what I can see:\r\n> https://github.com/mavlink/MAVSDK/blob/main/src/plugins/ftp/include/plugins/ftp/ftp.h\r\n> I only see it included in the implementation:\r\n> \r\n> https://github.com/mavlink/MAVSDK/blob/14d1878024cf7531022cdc9622039988f86bfbfe/src/plugins/ftp/ftp_impl.h#L7\r\n> \r\n> which I think is fine and expected as most plugins do require mavlink in the implementation.\r\n> Does that make sense? Do you see an issue with this?\r\n\r\nI'm afraid that I cannot undertand what you mean. \r\nI just think that mavlink need not to be included twice.\r\nmavsdk-windows-x64-release-0.43.0.zip\\include\\mavsdk\\plugins\\ftp\\mavlink folder can be deleted.\r\nBut I am not sure.\r\n\r\n\r\n", "author_association": "NONE", "pin": null, "reactions": {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/comments/925957809/reactions", "total_count": 0, "+1": 0, "-1": 0, "laugh": 0, "hooray": 0, "confused": 0, "heart": 0, "rocket": 0, "eyes": 0}, "performed_via_github_app": null, "minimized": null}, {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/comments/926405372", "html_url": "https://github.com/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/1561#issuecomment-926405372", "issue_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/1561", "id": 926405372, "node_id": "IC_kwDOBabE0s43N9L8", "user": {"login": "julianoes", "id": 1419688, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjE0MTk2ODg=", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1419688?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes", "html_url": "https://github.com/julianoes", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/repos", "events_url": "https://ap